  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BerachainOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Berachain — an EVM-compatible L1 with Proof-of-Liquidity consensus (mainnet 2025). Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on Berachain Mainnet. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- feat: add 3 new OASIS providers — AbstractOASIS, BerachainOASIS, StellarOASIS (59c3caa)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- feat: complete Edge offline runtime and release automation (279c090)\n- fix: delete BerrachainOASIS (typo duplicate), fix BerachainOASIS ProviderType enum ref, clean up solution and Startup.cs (8e4eabc)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BerachainOASIS",
